# Report Shell Vocabulary

When building or editing focus-panel presenters, use the shared shell so StatusBar visibility toggles work globally.

**Canonical doc:** `talia-ui/src/components/COMPONENT-STANDARDS.md` § Report Shell Vocabulary.

## Shell order (inside `.talia-report`)

1. `header.talia-report__header` — **Title** + **Subtitle** only
2. `.talia-report-filters` — **Talia filters** (panel criteria row)
3. `.talia-callout` — **Callouts** (0+)
4. `.talia-report__actions-bar` — **Actions** (Refresh, Export)
5. `main.talia-report__content` — **Content**; wrap tables in `ReportDataDetails` when Details (≣) applies

## Naming traps

| Term | Means | Does NOT mean |
|------|-------|---------------|
| **Talia filters** | `.talia-report-filters` row | Tabulator column filters |
| **Column filters** | Tabulator `headerFilter` / `.tabulator-header-filter` | `.talia-report-filters` |
| **Controls** | StatusBar global criteria strip (Date, Dur, …) | Panel filter inputs |
| **Actions** | `.talia-report__actions-bar` | Filter dropdowns |
| **Details** | `ReportDataDetails` / header ≣ | Tab ⓘ technical meta |

## Required classes for toggles

- Titles → `talia-report__header`, `talia-report__title`
- Filters → `talia-report-filters`
- Callouts → `talia-callout`
- Actions → `talia-report__actions-bar` (not mixed into title or filter rows)
- Column filters → Tabulator `headerFilter` only (no extra panel wrapper)

Do not add panel-specific visibility toggles. Reference: `AgencyPresenter.jsx`, `PublishedRatesGridPresenter.jsx`.
